sequenceDiagram
    actor User as You (New Relic UI)
    participant FC as Fleet Control
    participant AC as Agent Control
    participant Agent as Managed Agent
    participant PC as Pipeline Control
    participant NR as New Relic Platform

    User->>FC: Define desired state (agents, versions, config)
    FC->>AC: Send desired state via OpAMP
    AC->>Agent: Deploy / configure / upgrade
    Note over AC,Agent: Rolling update with health checks
    Agent->>Agent: Collect telemetry
    AC->>FC: Report health status
    Agent->>PC: Send telemetry (optional)
    PC->>PC: Apply filter rules
    PC->>NR: Deliver filtered telemetry
    Agent-->>NR: (or send directly without Pipeline Control)
